Maintainer: Jonghyeon Park <shapelayer.dev@gmail.com>
Description: Provides Korean morphological analysis, part-of-speech tagging,
    noun extraction, Hangul conversion utilities, concordance search, mutual
    information statistics, and dictionary management tools for Korean text
    research. The analyzer backend is derived from KoNLP and HanNanum.
